y","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent20RetryByCountStrategyC","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/RetryByCountStrategy"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Equatable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SQ","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"E","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The maximum number of times to retry the upstream, defaulting to 1.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"retries"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The specific error that should trigger a retry.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"error"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"code":"AsyncSequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that emits the same output as the upstream but retries on the specified error up to the specified number of times.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method returns an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that retries the upstream only when the specified error occurs, up to the given number of retries."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"type":"text","text":"s can be retried. For example, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncStream"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncThrowingStream"},{"type":"text","text":" cannot be retried on their own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Exam